    "turn_text": "they weren't fans of me at all. And when I ran for Congress again, both John McCain and Jeff Flake endorsed my opponent Kirk Adams. Rand commercials for him did everything they could to help him get elected. And it's because I don't pull any punches. If somebody's a Republican and they lie, or if somebody's a Republican and they don't keep the promises that we made, then I speak out. And I'm not trying to be a jerk about it. It's just that I signed up to get a job done. I believe in the Constitution with everything that I got. And I believe that if we actually only passed constitutional laws, The budget would be balanced by next Tuesday because there's so much friggin stuff in the in Washington, DC that is that is passed oversight that is like the Department of Education. I sponsored legislation every year that I was there to get rid of the federal Department of Education. You show me in the Constitution in the enumerated powers where education center is not.",
