    "turn_idx": 77,
    "turn_text": "Okay, so let me let me run through a couple of other things here so Tell me what makes you jump back in because you've had kind of two stints as part of that largest legislative thing, right? You took a crack at this executive thing and unfortunate alignment of events and wins, right? And that happens a lot of times. That's the way it goes. What makes you come back?",
