    "turn_idx": 126,
    "turn_text": "Well, when you think about it, Greg, Are people crossing the border in mass numbers in some of these socialist countries like the RRs? No, they're not because it doesn't work and they don't have a life that everybody dreams about. Everybody's crashing our borders because we've got a great lifestyle and the free market works and our economy is humming.",
