    "turn_text": "You know, I run into Taiwanese and I love chatting with Taiwanese. I was in Vegas setting up a store there and we had a Taiwanese fan of our company come in and we started talking and he said, oh, I want to take you to my favorite Taiwanese place for lunch. So I went with him to get some dumplings. And that's the best. We sat down and started talking, and he was talking about his father coming here from Taiwan, and I was asking him about China, and he was talking. He's like, my dad loves you. He's anti-China, like unhinged about it.",
